        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Lokomotiv Yaroslavl, Loko Yaroslavl, KHL team\n- Places: Yaroslavl, Russia, Tunoshna Airport, Volga River\n- Events: Lokomotiv Yaroslavl plane crash\n- Topics: ice hockey\n\nFacts:\n- Lokomotiv Yaroslavl is an ice hockey team in Yaroslavl, Russia.\n- In 2011, Lokomotiv Yaroslavl was founded after the entire KHL team and its coaching staff died in the Lokomotiv Yaroslavl plane crash.\n- In 2011, Lokomotiv Yaroslavl consisted of MHL players from Loko Yaroslavl.\n- In the Lokomotiv Yaroslavl plane crash, the aircraft ran off the runway before lifting off, struck a tower mast, caught fire, and crashed 2 km from Tunoshna Airport on the bank of the Volga River.",
